# `brevi build` without -o writes the program into the current folder: at the top of the checkout, ignore
# every file without an extension except the ones listed (tools/no_binaries.py also checks this in CI).
# This block comes first so the folder rules below still apply.
/*
!/*.*
!/*/
!/LICENSE
!/Dockerfile
/target
bench/work/
site/out/
site/out-run/
__pycache__/
/dist
runtime/*/target/
runtime/*/Cargo.lock
bench/fuzz/found/
